From cff726abfe875f94a2ec9c2be00289d3461467e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Satish Ramachandran <satish.ramachandran@broadcom.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Jan 2026 17:31:06 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] linux-esx: Add SBX DTLS kernel module.

This kernel driver is for the SBX DTLS virtual device. This driver
helps the userspace applications (like SDP) to communicate with the
SBX device which facilitates the sharing of memory between the workload
VMs and the SCRX.

Signed-off-by: Satish Ramachandran <satish.ramachandran@broadcom.com>
